(7052929, 1072251, 93283, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first Ribbon Jane!!! Well deserved!!! Love the placement of the dog with the statue of the dog :)</td>', 'Congrats on your first Ribbon Jane!!! Well deserved!!! Love the placement of the dog with the statue of the dog :)', '2013-06-17 21:34:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7052937, 1072264, 67697, '<td valign="top">Not too boring at all :D  Congrats on 4th place!</td>', 'Not too boring at all :D  Congrats on 4th place!', '2013-06-17 22:27:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7052956, 1072203, 24073, '<td valign="top">I was checking out this challenge, and I came upon this photo.  The challenge, IMO, was not that great, and the photos submitted the same, but I like this one.  I like it, but I''m confused with where you was headed with the grainy approach.  It would appear to me that you could of had a really fair shot at winning this thing if you just stuck to the basic principles.  I''ve over thought many of my photos, actually I''m really bad about it, but I was wondering if you had time to let me in on where you was headed with your vision.  Again I love it, I would of still given you a solid score if I would of voted.  Great job.</td>', 'I was checking out this challenge, and I came upon this photo.  The challenge, IMO, was not that great, and the photos submitted the same, but I like this one.  I like it, but I''m confused with where you was headed with the grainy approach.  It would appear to me that you could of had a really fair shot at winning this thing if you just stuck to the basic principles.  I''ve over thought many of my photos, actually I''m really bad about it, but I was wondering if you had time to let me in on where you was headed with your vision.  Again I love it, I would of still given you a solid score if I would of voted.  Great job.', '2013-06-18 00:03:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7052959, 1072251, 113411, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much for your wonderful comments. This was really a complete surprise. My score was in the <br/>high 5''s for most of the voting and I never imagined I would finish in the top 5 It''s a great feeling.<br/>DPC is a great place to learn and I am happy to be a part of this community and so grateful to my former<br/>teammates, Mark, JP and Ashley who were so helpful to a total rookie.<br/> <br/>Really, thank you!<br/>Jane</td>', 'Thanks so much for your wonderful comments. This was really a complete surprise. My score was in the high 5''s for most of the voting and I never imagined I would finish in the top 5 It''s a great feeling.DPC is a great place to learn and I am happy to be a part of this community and so grateful to my formerteammates, Mark, JP and Ashley who were so helpful to a total rookie. Really, thank you!Jane', '2013-06-18 00:10:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7052998, 1072156, 159196, '<td valign="top">Well done on coming 6th - you sure didn''t waste any time getting started with the challenges!!</td>', 'Well done on coming 6th - you sure didn''t waste any time getting started with the challenges!!', '2013-06-18 04:33:30.000000', NULL, 0),
